<aura:documentation>
	<aura:description>
    <p>Create Offering Form CHECKBOX Component</p>

    <!-- LAST UPDATED DATE / VERSION -->
    <p>Last Updated: 6/4/2019</p>
    <p>CurrentVersion: 2.1</p>
<pre>Outline for future performance gain on Search:
- set up checkboxes initially
- assign each checkbox unique ID
- update UI manually using document.querySelector()
- make sure data-binding value stays in sync with UI
</pre>
    <hr/>
    <!-- UPDATE DATE / VERSION WITH ANY UPDATES -->
		<p>See attribute descriptions for more details.</p>
    <p>Child inputs can also be of subType <code>text</code> and <code>radio</code>.</p>
    <p>Specifications example:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>interactionType: <code>parent</code></li>
      <li>valueType: <code>complex</code></li>
      <li>accordionType: <code>search</code></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Example options:</p>
<pre>[
  {
    label: 'Option 1 ®',
    value: 'opt1',
    additionalValues: {
      relatedId: 'related info'
    },
    children: [
      {
        label: 'Child Option 1 ®',
        value: 'chopt1',
        children: [
          {
            label: 'Child Option 1A ®',
            value: 'chopt1A'
          },
          {
            label: 'Child Option 2A ®',
            value: 'chopt2A',
            children: [
              {
                label: 'Child Radio Options',
                value: 'radioIdX897',
                subType: 'radio',
                radioOptions: [
                  {
                    label: 'One',
                    value: 'one'
                  },
                  {
                    label: 'Two',
                    value: 'two'
                  },
                  {
                    label: 'Three',
                    value: 'three'
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                label: 'Child Option 4',
                value: 'textIdX298',
                subType: 'text',
                textValue: '',
                additionalValues: {
                  relatedId: 'XX2323'
                }
              },
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        label: 'Child Option 2',
        value: 'chopt2'
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    label: 'Option 2',
    value: 'opt2'
  }
]</pre>
